WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.445
Where stars are born.

00:02.145 --> 00:08.572
This is the Orion Nebula, an enormous cloud of gas and dust more than a thousand light-years away.

00:09.022 --> 00:12.046
Gravity pulls its thickest knots together.

00:12.496 --> 00:16.484
Where a knot grows hot enough in the middle, a star switches on.

00:16.934 --> 00:20.590
Vast numbers of new stars are being made here right now.
